## Category: SSH & secrets

# NOTE: the 1Password *app* is deliberately NOT here — it is installed by hand
# from 1password.com before this repo is even cloned, because its SSH agent
# holds the git key (see docs/bootstrap.md step 5). It self-updates via
# Sparkle, so brew has nothing to add. Listed in docs/manual-installs.md.
# The CLI below is a separate package and is not covered by that install.
#
# 1Password command-line — `op read op://...` for secret access in scripts.
# Distributed as a signed pkg, hence cask (not a brew formula).
# why: op read op://... for secret access in scripts
cask "1password-cli"

